2 CLEAR300
5 GOTO120
10 CLS
20 FORY=1TO4:CLS
40 PRINT@448,"BEST TEAM ??????"
50 FORX=1TO500:NEXTX
60 CLS
70 PRINT@448+32,"SPEECH TEAM !!!!!!!"
80 FORX=1TO500:NEXTX
90 NEXT Y
92 CLS
95 PRINT@1000,"";
110 FORY=1TO1000:PRINT"YA!  ";:NEXT
120 CLS
130 PRINT@448,"HOW MANY COACHES (PLAYERS) WILL PARTICAPATE";
